<p><a href="/alcohol-recommendations/#peach-schnapps">Peach Schnapps</a> is a peach-flavoured variant of the Schnapps alcoholic drink.</p>
<p>Schnapps may take several forms:</p>
<ul>
<li>Distilled Fruit Brandy.</li>
<li>Herbal Liqueurs.</li>
<li>Infusions – i.e. the process of extracting flavours from plant material in solvent such as water, oil, or in the case of Schnapps – alcohol.</li>
<li>Flavour Liqueurs – this is where Peach Schnapps comes in.</li>
</ul>
<p>The word <em>Schnapps</em> is a German term that refers to any kind of strong Alcoholic drink and over the years has become known as a style of drink. <a href="/what-is-peach-schnapps/">More about that here</a>.</p>
